{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10192","headline":"赠王八衢 · 李嘉佑","name":"赠王八衢","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丹地偏相逐，清江若有期。\n腰金才子贵，剖竹老人迟。\n桂楫闲迎客，茶瓯对说诗。\n渚田分邑里，山桂树罘罳。\n心静无华发，人和似古时。\n别君远山去，幽独更应悲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李嘉佑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10192.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10192","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}